* q + total beyond."] [574 1 "// mathMaybeSpecial is _PyObject_MaybeCallSpecialNoArgs: o's type's special method called (its descriptor"] [575 1 "// bound), found false when the type has none."] [585 1 "// mathRound is math_floor and math_ceil: an exact float directly, else __floor__/__ceil__, else"] [586 1 "// PyFloat_AsDouble; PyLong_FromDouble of the result."] [610 1 "// mathTrunc is math_trunc."] [622 1 "// mathPermComb is math_perm and math_comb: n and k by __index__, arbitrary n, k (min(k, n - k) for comb) in C's"] [623 1 "// long long."] [630 28 "// math_factorial"] [676 1 "// mathNextafter is math_nextafter: musl's nextafter for one step (y when x == y), else CPython's steps."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[83 24] [87 29] [194 14] [194 22] [199 13] [199 21] [382 24] [385 22] [445 24] [471 52] [589 25] [596 31] [612 25] [666 19] [666 27]] :go/trails [[180 54]]} (go/file "math_extra.go" :imports [


